@*
    The reconnection dialog, driven by Blazor's own reconnection events.

    Why this is not a Polaris component: it has to work when the SignalR circuit is gone, and its
    markup is a contract with `blazor.web.js`, which toggles the `components-reconnect-*` classes on
    the element whose id is `components-reconnect-modal` and fires
    `components-reconnect-state-changed` on it. The ids and class names below are that contract — do
    not rename them.

    What it fixes: without this, a dropped circuit leaves a page whose controls do nothing at all,
    with no spinner, no message and no way to recover except a manual reload. The markup is static
    (no render mode), because a component that needs a circuit cannot report a missing circuit.

    The styles are in wwwroot/css/reconnect-modal.css and the behaviour in
    wwwroot/js/reconnect-modal.js, both loaded by App.razor.
*@
<dialog id="components-reconnect-modal" data-nosnippet>
    <div class="components-reconnect-container">
        <div class="components-rejoining-animation" aria-hidden="true">
            <div></div>
            <div></div>
        </div>
        <p class="components-reconnect-first-attempt-visible">
            Rejoining the server...
        </p>
        <p class="components-reconnect-repeated-attempt-visible">
            Rejoin failed... trying again in <span id="components-seconds-to-next-attempt"></span> seconds.
        </p>
        <p class="components-reconnect-failed-visible">
            Failed to rejoin.<br />Please retry or reload the page.
        </p>
        <button id="components-reconnect-button" class="components-reconnect-failed-visible">
            Retry
        </button>
        <p class="components-pause-visible">
            The session has been paused by the server.
        </p>
        <p class="components-resume-failed-visible">
            Failed to resume the session.<br />Please retry or reload the page.
        </p>
        <button id="components-resume-button" class="components-pause-visible components-resume-failed-visible">
            Resume
        </button>
    </div>
</dialog>
